# LitTrans plugin issues

Defects and design traps of the `literature-translation` plugin found while translating this
document, for later plugin iteration.

> **Maintenance.** This file is a cumulative ledger. Append every behaviour that is wrong,
> contradicts the documentation or is easy to misuse to the "Ledger" section; do not open a
> second file. Each entry gives reproducible evidence — the symbol name (line numbers move
> between builds), the reproduction command and the observed result — not only a conclusion.

